      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُحْمٌ</span></b> : see its syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحْمَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُّ رُحْمٍ</span>
